		match producer 'produces'
			required or
			callerLine or
			callerFile then panic("sweptParamDefaultHelperName: '{String.from(ownerName)}' declares a default on CALL-ALIGNED parameter {paramIndex} that the real parse captured as an expression, and the declaration sweep published no helper at that position — `recordScannedParamDefaults` and `parseFunctionParameters` walk the same parameter list and have come apart on whether it holds a `=`, on where the parameter sits in it, or on whether `callerLocationDefaultAt` calls that default a caller-location keyword")
